OL,3,GNEWSAActor Stanley Tucci spotted trying
OL,4,AWelsh cakes at Cardiff Market
OL,5,
OL,6,FActor Stanley Tucci was spotted
OL,7,Fvisiting the food stalls at Cardiff
OL,8,FMarket and trying some Welsh cakes as
OL,9,Fpart of a new TV series.
OL,11,FThe Devil Wears Prada star visited the
OL,12,Ffamily-run Cardiff Bakestones, with
OL,13,Fowner Adam El Tagoury describing Tucci
OL,14,Fas a "humble, genuine guy" during the
OL,15,Fvisit.
OL,17,FEl Tagoury said the A-list visit had
OL,18,Falso had a positive impact on business,
OL,19,Fwith the bakery experiencing the
OL,20,F"busiest day we've ever had outside of
OL,21,FSt. David's Day".
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
